  "question": {
    "text": "<p>Let <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mo>:</mo><mo>(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#8734;</mo><mo>)</mo><mo>&#8594;</mo><mo>(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#8734;</mo><mo>)</mo></math> be a differentiable function such that <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mo>(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>e</mi></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><munder><mi>lim</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></munder><mfrac><mrow><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><msup><mi>f</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><msup><mi>f</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>)</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo></math> If<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>f</mi><mo>(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math>, then <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi></math> is equal to:</p>"
  },
